  "result": "I fixed it: `acceptInvitation` in `src/server/services/invitation-service.ts` now refuses a link when `revokedAt` is set.\n\nThe function already rejected links that had been used or were too old, but it never looked at `revokedAt`. So a cancelled invitation was still accepted and created a membership. The new check sits right after the \"already accepted\" check and raises \"That invitation has been revoked\". This is the error that the existing test in `tests/services/invitation-service.test.ts` (\"refuses an expired or revoked invitation token\") expects. I haven't run the test suite.\n\nSeparately, the Gmail and Google Drive connectors need authorizing in your claude.ai connector settings before they can be used. This fix didn't need them.",
